 "remarks": "Experience elevated downtown Stamford living at Hayes House. Originally configured as a 3-bedroom, 2-bath residence, this approximately 1,525-square-foot home was thoughtfully reimagined as a spacious 2-bedroom, 2-bath layout to create an exceptional, oversized open kitchen and dining area-ideal for everyday living and entertaining. An oversized balcony extends the living space and captures sunset views. Both bedrooms are generously proportioned, and the residence includes two covered garage spaces. Monthly HOA includes front-desk reception, heat, central air, hot water, grounds maintenance, trash pickup, pest control, insurance, and property management. Enjoy a central location with a Walk Score of 87, placing Stamford's shops, restaurants, and everyday conveniences close by.",
